### Cek database
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Daftar latihan
GET http://localhost:3000/workouts

### Kategori
GET http://localhost:3000/categories

### 1. Minta kode verifikasi
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "tes@mail.com" }

### 2. Daftar (ganti 123456 dengan devCode dari langkah 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tes@mail.com",
  "code": "982868",
  "firstName": "Tes",
  "lastName": "User",
  "birthDate": "2000-01-31",
  "marketingOptIn": false
}

### 3. Profil (ganti TOKEN_DI_SINI dengan token dari langkah 2)
GET http://localhost:3000/me
